# Semantic-authoring gate ratchet (shrink-only).
# Tracked api_/fct_/int_ models that predate the gate and have no semantic
# authoring yet. Author a model (scripts/semantic/scaffold_candidates.py
# scaffolds a candidate block) and delete its line; stale lines fail the gate.
# Seeded 2026-07 from the live manifest.
